nce over 40 models including fighters, attack aircraft and bombers. Learn to master a Spitfire, the Mustang, Messerschmitts and many more;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible difficulty level system: from arcade to realistic simulation;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support of 6-DOF TrackIR, TripleHead2Go, Saitek and Thrustmaster joysticks, mouse and voice headsets;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic sound effects and an original musical score from Jeremy Soule. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note! Multiplayer for Wings of Prey is no longer supported!</strong></p>","developers":["Gaijin Entertainment Corporation"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/45300/a99a61bee6466da924edfad851a8960380c96994/header.jpg?t=1773415136","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Gaijin Entertainment Corporation, 2005-2010","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"metacritic":{"score":78,"url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/pc/wings-of-prey?ftag=MCD-06-10aaa1f"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/45300/571480/fe38e35352cee157b0e2fb7d776c64541d5c81f0/1751246979/dash_av1.mpd?t=1685004340","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/45300/571480/fe38e35352cee157b0e2fb7d776c64541d5c81f0/1751246979/dash_h264.mpd?t=1685004340","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/45300/571480/fe38e35352cee157b0e2fb7d776c64541d5c81f0/1751246979/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1685004340","id":256948938,"name":"Wings of Prey","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256948938/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1685004340"}],"name":"Wings of Prey: Special Edition","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a p